Below is a **step‑by‑step playbook** you can follow to build a modern, production‑ready frontend for an e‑commerce site.  
I’ll cover the whole stack – from design to deployment – and give you concrete code snippets, folder layouts, and tool recommendations so you can jump straight into coding.

---

## 1️⃣ Define the Scope & Gather Requirements

| Feature | Description | Priority |
|---------|-------------|----------|
| **Product catalog** | Browse, filter, sort, pagination | ★★★ |
| **Product detail** | Images, description, variants, reviews | ★★★ |
| **Cart & checkout** | Add‑to‑cart, quantity, coupon, shipping, payment | ★★★ |
| **User accounts** | Register, login, profile, order history | ★★ |
| **Admin panel** | CRUD products, orders, users | ★ |
| **SEO & performance** | SSR/ISR, meta tags, lazy loading | ★★ |
| **Accessibility** | WCAG 2.1 AA | ★★ |

> **Tip:** Write a short “feature spec” for each item. It will become your checklist during development.

---

## 2️⃣ Pick a Frontend Framework

| Option | Pros | Cons |
|--------|------|------|
| **Next.js (React)** | SSR/ISR, file‑based routing, API routes, great ecosystem | Slight learning curve if you’re new to React |
| **Nuxt.js (Vue)** | Similar to Next, but Vue‑centric | Less mature ecosystem than Next |
| **SvelteKit** | Smaller bundle, simpler reactivity | Smaller community, fewer plugins |

**Recommendation:** **Next.js** – it’s battle‑tested for e‑commerce, has built‑in image optimization, and works well with headless CMSs and payment APIs.

---

## 3️⃣ Project Skeleton (Next.js)

```bash
npx create-next-app@latest ecommerce-frontend
cd ecommerce-frontend
```

### Suggested folder layout

```
/components   # Reusable UI pieces
  /ui         # UI primitives (Button, Card, Modal)
  /layout     # Header, Footer, Sidebar
  /product    # ProductCard, ProductGallery
  /cart       # CartItem, CartSummary
  /auth       # LoginForm, RegisterForm
/pages
  /api        # Serverless API routes (if needed)
  /products   # /products/[slug].tsx
  /cart.tsx
  /checkout.tsx
  /account
    /orders.tsx
    /profile.tsx
  /admin
    /products.tsx
    /orders.tsx
  /index.tsx
  /404.tsx
  /500.tsx
/public
  /images
  /fonts
/styles
  /globals.css
  /theme.css
  /tailwind.css
```

---

## 4️⃣ UI Toolkit & Styling

| Tool | Why |
|------|-----|
| **Tailwind CSS** | Utility‑first, fast prototyping, responsive out‑of‑the‑box |
| **Shadcn/ui** | Headless UI components built on Radix + Tailwind |
| **Headless UI** | Accessible primitives (Dialog, Menu, Transition) |
| **React Hook Form + Zod** | Form handling + schema validation |
| **React Query / SWR** | Data fetching, caching, optimistic updates |
| **Stripe.js** | Checkout integration |
| **Auth.js (NextAuth)** | OAuth, email/password, JWT |

> **Setup Tailwind** (in `tailwind.config.js`):

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./pages/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
    "./components/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

---

## 5️⃣ Core Features – Code Snippets

### 5.1 Product Card (components/product/ProductCard.tsx)

```tsx
import Image from 'next/image';
import Link from 'next/link';
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button';

export interface ProductCardProps {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  price: number;
  imageUrl: string;
  rating?: number;
}

export const ProductCard = ({
  id,
  title,
  price,
  imageUrl,
  rating = 0,
}: ProductCardProps) => (
  <div className="border rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition">
    <Link href={`/products/${id}`}>
      <a>
        <Image src={imageUrl} alt={title} width={300} height={300} className="object-cover w-full h-48" />
        <div className="p-4">
          <h3 className="font-semibold text-lg truncate">{title}</h3>
          <p className="text-gray-600">${price.toFixed(2)}</p>
          <div className="flex items-center mt-2">
            {[...Array(5)].map((_, i) => (
              <svg
                key={i}
                className={`w-4 h-4 ${i < rating ? 'text-yellow-400' : 'text-gray-300'}`}
                fill="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 20 20"
              >
                <path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.286 3.956a1 1 0 00.95.69h4.158c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-3.37 2.45a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.286 3.956c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.538 1.118l-3.37-2.45a1 1 0 00-1.176 0l-3.37 2.45c-.783.57-1.838-.197-1.538-1.118l1.286-3.956a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.7 9.383c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h4.158a1 1 0 00.95-.69l1.286-3.956z" />
